<title>USA: Northwest Air says AMR pact will up fares.</title>
<headline>Northwest Air says AMR pact will up fares.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwest Airlines Corp said on Thursday that an alliance between British Airways Plc and AMR Corp's American Airlines will result in reduced service and increased fares in all major U.S.-Heathrow markets.</p>
<p>Northwest said that no consultant's report paid for by American Airlines can alter these &quot;facts&quot;.</p>
<p>Earlier today, American Airlines said it is suing Northwest for allegedly trying to stop a consulting firm from completing a study commissioned by American on its proposed alliance.</p>
